# தமிழ் இலக்கணம் — Login + Chat shell

## Files
- `app.py` — Flask backend (register, login, chat page, logout, `/api/send` placeholder)
- `templates/index.html` — login/register page (the design you sent)
- `templates/chat.html` — empty chatbot page shown after login
- `static/style.css` — shared stylesheet
- `requirements.txt` — Python dependencies
For Ollama:

If venv is NOT there

->Create a new virtual environment inside this new project location:

      python -m venv venv

Wait until it finishes.

->Then install the packages:

       venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install flask requests psycopg2-binary werkzeug

->Then run:

      venv\Scripts\python.exe app.py
If you get the same PowerShell error

Use:

      .\venv\Scripts\python.exe app.py

Notice the .\ at the beginning.

